    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>WooCommerce extension that allows you to easily control &#8220;Add to Cart&#8221; button on single product page. You can allow or disallow &#8220;Add to Cart&#8221; button with just one click or specify<br />\ntime frame inside which is product purchasable (with nice countdown). That way you can have some special offers or limited time offers for your clients and shoppers.</p>\n<h4>License</h4>\n<p>Unless otherwise specified, all the theme files, scripts and images are licensed under GNU General Public Licemse.</p>\n",
